<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia July producer prices rise 5.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenia July producer prices rise 5.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday:</p>
<p>    SLOVENIA PRODUCER PRICES     July   June   July 96</p>
<p>    Monthly change (pct)	    +0.1   +0.8   +0.4</p>
<p>    Year/year change (pct)	  +5.9   +6.2   +7.4</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
